  "docTitle": "Web Crawler - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a polite, distributed web crawler that fetches a billion pages a month: URL frontier with per-host queues, robots.txt, DNS caching, Bloom-filter URL dedup, SimHash content dedup, crawler traps, recrawl scheduling, and where Kafka, Kubernetes and Docker fit.",
  "hero": {
