      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span><span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Atlassian</span><span class=\"chip company\">Google</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Web Crawler</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design the robot that reads the web: it fetches a billion pages a month, never hammers one website, never reads the same page twice, never gets stuck in an endless maze, and survives machines dying under it. By the end you can drive this 45-minute interview from the first question to the last follow-up.</p>\n      "
